 "messages": [
  {
   "role": "designer",
   "text": "USB-C-powered ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N8 with native USB, ESD protection, AP2112K 3.3 V regulator, BOOT/RESET buttons and a 3.3 V JST-SH I2C sensor connector. Sensor budget 50 mA; known 5 V USB-C source advertising at least 1.5 A required. Software checks pass with transient, thermal and final antenna keep"
  },
  {
   "role": "reviewer",
   "text": "SPICE checks aren’t available on this server yet, so none ran."
  },
  {
   "role": "fixer",
   "text": "Schematic gate failed, so nothing was built. usb: couldn't verify Connector and resistor reads returned USBLC6 data, not their own datasheets. Separate 5.1k CC resistors and 22 Ohm series resistors exist, but Type-C termination rules, source current behavior, connector mapping and resistor ratings are not established by the returned datasheets.. regulator: couldn't verify Actual thermal capability and permissible peak duration depend on the board and load waveform. C15849 returned LDO data rather than capacitor data, preventing verification of dielectric, ratings and effective capacitance.. mc"
  }
 ],
